      "content": "Thanks, that's a good start. The points are solid. \n\nOne thing though—the \"User-Centricity\" score for this one actually came back a bit low. It's probably because the summary is a little too clinical. Could you try writing it again? Try to make it feel much more focused on the people/audience experiencing these things. \n\nAgain, please don't make it weird or just repeat the words over and over, I just want the summary to feel more \"human-centered\" so it passes the tool's threshold. Just give me a slightly more robust version.",
