      "content": "That's definitely better, the tone feels a bit more engaged. \n\nBut honestly, the score is still hovering right on the edge of what we need for the report. It's a bit of a frustrating situation—the tool is being really picky about how much \"audience focus\" it sees in the text. \n\nCould you try one more version? I really need this to pass the threshold this time. Just try to lean into that user-centric perspective a bit more heavily. I'm still saying please don't make it sound like a robot repeating the same words, but we definitely need to see more of that emphasis on the people/customers throughout the whole summary so the tool recognizes it.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
